e)],core_overview=dict(status='incomplete',formation=dict(explanation='A leader assigns entry term/index, replicates and counts Match acknowledgements through active voter quorums. Current-term matching gates commit advancement. Followers match the preceding entry and reject committed-prefix conflicts; Ready exposes committed work to the caller.',behavior_ids=['B-proposal','B-ready'],source_ids=['S-formation','S-ack','S-log','S-termcommit','S-quorum','S-ready']),context=dict(explanation='Campaign and term handling acquire or lose leader authority. Real candidacy increments term; reset discards peer support and readOnly tracking. A new leader retains history, appends an empty current-term entry and conservatively delays configuration proposals until prior history is applied.',behavior_ids=['B-context'],source_ids=['S-reset','S-election','S-terms']),connection=dict(explanation='Progress support is leader-context local, while committed history survives reset. Configuration application changes quorum interpretation and can itself advance commit. Persistence-qualified replies connect durable history to election and append support; old-term storage completion cannot discard potentially overwritten unstable entries.',behavior_ids=['B-proposal','B-context','B-config','B-ready'],source_ids=['S-config','S-reset','S-terms','S-durability','S-quorum']),core_gaps=['Trace actual voter-set construction and restoration, and caller ordering for application and completion.','Finish representative election aggregation, snapshot recovery, Node dispatch, and old/pending read handling before declaring overview usable.'],open_details=['Configuration-driven commit versus pending read release.','Contradictory current-batch persistence/send guidance.'],rationale='Partial sourced backbone retained early; no formal Candidate basis or execution claim yet.'))\njson.dump(m,open('map-initial.json','w'),indent=2)\ns=dict(action='research',rationale='Retain initial sourced backbone and two specific u